            "review_text": "matt n frank\nBrighton, United Kingdom818 contributions\n0\nYum\nFeb 2025 • Couples\nWe had several Bahn mi throughout our stay, i mean it is almost expected when visiting Viet nam.\n\nThis was the most memorable, it wasn’t the cheapest or the most expensive, it wasn’t the fanciest we had not the basic we tried. However I have to say this one hit the spot, fresh ingredients amazing flavours and textures. I almost went back again that’s how good it was.\n\nIt’s set in a little courtyard off the main road with some other restaurants, but this one was a food truck (a nice one) in the heart of the area.\n\nTry it\nRead more\nWritten February 23, 2025",
