            "review_text": "tama105\nTaipei, Taiwan2019 contributions\n0\nCospa good bread and slightly stiff\nAug 2024 • Business\nPlease note that there is a kitchen car in the intricate courtyard from Hai Bà Trưng Street, which is hard to find from the street. There are seats outside, but you can also order food and drink inside Vietnam Select Shop, where the air conditioner next door works. Banh mi was delicious, but the outside of the bread is as hard as rice crackers, so be careful if you don't like to chew your teeth weakly. Bánh Mì 362 is better than here if you're after Banh mi with a limited number of meals. Taste, cost and location are good.\nRead more\nTranslated from Japanese\nShow original\nWritten August 16, 2024",
