            "review_title": "Review at Banh Mi 74",
            "review_text": "NR\n9 contributions\n1\nHidden Gem\nDec 2022\nThis restaurant is a small trailer located in a courtyard between a few other restaurants (Hoa Tuc and El Gaucho). They only serve Banh Mi, but boy do they do it well. I had a delicious egg/omelette banh mi which I took to go as I had a flight out. Even though I waited a few hours, the sandwich was still delicious. The bread was fresh, the eggs were fluffy, and the herbs and chilies really made it pop. \n\nWhen I chatted with the owner she said she had been open since October. Any one in the area should definitely visit. Highly recommend!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 20, 2023",
